          %p
            This appears as (
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"}> Lurie, remark 3.2.3
            ). A proof is written down in (
            %a{:href => "#Haugseng14"}> Haugseng 14, corollary 6.6
            ).
          .num_conjecture
            %h6#conjecture Conjecture
            %p
              The canonical
              = succeed "-" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi O
