            This appears as (
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"}> Lurie, claim 3.2.4
            ).
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symplectic+category"} symplectic category
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/span+trace"} span trace
            %li
